# AI Resume Feedback Tool - NeuroFive Capstone

## Problem
Job seekers don't know if their resume will pass ATS systems or impress recruiters.

## Solution
An AI-powered web app that gives instant, structured feedback on resumes.
User inputs: Resume text + Target Job Title
AI Output: ATS Score, Summary, Strengths, Improvements, Rewritten Bullet

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript
- Backend: Python, Flask
- AI: OpenAI GPT-4o-mini API
- Advanced: Structured JSON Output for reliable parsing

## How to Run
1. `pip install flask openai`
2. Add your OpenAI key in `app.py`
3. `python app.py`
4. Open http://127.0.0.1:5000

